TilauScope is a modified version of Artisan Roaster Scope.

  Artisan Roaster Scope
  Copyright (c) Marko Luther and the Artisan contributors
  https://github.com/artisan-roaster-scope/artisan

Modifications by Tilau began in 2025 and are ongoing. They add a guided
assistance layer for home and amateur roasters — roast planning, automated
milestone detection, a bean database, preheat PID control, remote piloting from
a phone, and integration with several Bluetooth roasting accessories. Files and
code sections added or altered by this fork are marked with a `## TILAU ##`
comment.


